---
import ContactForm from '@/components/forms/ContactForm.astro';
---
<section class="section bg-white" id="contact">
  <div class="container grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr]">
    <div><p class="eyebrow mb-3">Contact</p><h2 class="h2">Get a free website review.</h2><p class="lead mt-4">Tell me about your business, current website, and what you want customers to do next. I’ll review the opportunity and recommend the next best step.</p><div class="mt-8 space-y-4 text-slate-600"><p><strong class="text-slate-950">Best for:</strong> local service businesses, coaches, contractors, restaurants, clinics, and professional offices.</p><p><strong class="text-slate-950">Response goal:</strong> clear next steps, not tech confusion.</p></div></div>
    <ContactForm />
  </div>
</section>
